==Finnish==
{{Finnish index|ku}}

===Indefinite pronoun===
'''kukaan'''
#(''In question clauses'') [[anybody]], [[anyone]]:
#:*Tietääkö '''kukaan''', missä se on?
#:**Does ''anybody'' know where it is?
#(''With the negative verb ([[en]], [[et]], [[ei]], [[emme]], [[ette]], [[eivät]])'') [[no-one]], [[none]], [[nobody]]:
#:*'''Kukaan''' [[ei]] [[haluta|halua]] [[sellainen|sellaista]] [[tulevaisuus|tulevaisuutta]] [[lapsi]]lleen.
#:**''None'' wants that kind of future for their children.

